Sheldon's out of town, so we can do whatever we want.

17
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:40,150
We even ordered from the Thai place he doesn't like.

18
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:40,860
Oh, how is it?

19
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:43,400
Disgusting. Do not tell him.

20
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:45,600
What do you guys want to do tonight?

21
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:46,710
I don't know.

22
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:48,310
Well, I told Howie if I wasn't busy,

23
00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:49,800
