25
00:00:55,530 --> 00:00:57,100
Stuart? Are you okay?

26
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:58,930
No, I don't feel so...

27
00:00:59,970 --> 00:01:01,330
- Oh, Stuart? - Stuart?

28
00:01:01,330 --> 00:01:03,510
Oh, my God, you guys need to do something!

29
