According to Wikipedia, Sherlock Holmes came first.

64
00:02:58,110 --> 00:03:01,010
Great, everyone's a Byomkesh Bakshi.

65
00:03:01,010 --> 00:03:03,900
Now... here are some

66
00:03:03,900 --> 00:03:06,690
