118
00:05:16,970 --> 00:05:18,460
Anyway, I was pretty lonely,

119
00:05:18,460 --> 00:05:20,730
so I had to make up my own stories and games,

120
00:05:20,730 --> 00:05:21,800
and I promised myself

121
