141
00:06:09,350 --> 00:06:12,400
Oh, does the gazelle know that according to Harlan Ellison,

142
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:14,930
it was not ripped off from Demon With a Glass Hand,

143
00:06:14,930 --> 00:06:17,730
but was ripped off from another Outer Limits script he wrote

144
00:06:17,730 --> 00:06:19,160
called The Soldier?

145
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:21,520
I'm gonna need another clue.

146
00:06:25,740 --> 00:06:26,370
Okay...

147
00:06:26,370 --> 00:06:28,460
give me the flowers and pie.

148
00:06:28,970 --> 00:06:30,480
But if we show up and you're holding them,

149
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,260
