152
00:06:37,870 --> 00:06:40,690
Yes... but now that I've seen what the gift of me

153
00:06:40,700 --> 00:06:42,170
with flowers and pie looks like,

154
00:06:42,170 --> 00:06:44,240
there's no going back.

155
00:06:45,620 --> 00:06:48,620
Boy, I can't wait to see the look on her face...

156
00:06:49,050 --> 00:06:50,250
We're leaving right now.

157
00:06:50,250 --> 00:06:51,420
- What's wrong? - Nothing.

158
00:06:51,420 --> 00:06:53,820
What? Sheldon, tell me what's going on!

159
00:06:53,820 --> 00:06:55,220
I saw my mommy with a naked man

160
