177
00:07:48,090 --> 00:07:50,160
and that I'll never forgive her?

178
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:53,600
Well, don't do it on the phone.

179
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,130
No, I'm just going to tell her I'm coming

180
00:07:55,130 --> 00:07:58,550
so she can give that Good Time Charlie the heave-ho.

181
00:07:59,670 --> 00:08:00,460
That's some tough talk.

182
00:08:00,460 --> 00:08:02,450
I may need to cut you off.

183
00:08:03,150 --> 00:08:03,940
Yeah, maybe you better.

184
00:08:03,940 --> 00:08:05,920
