196
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:52,870
And welcome to 20 years in the future.

197
00:08:55,390 --> 00:08:56,450
Hey, you guys just time-traveled.

198
00:08:56,450 --> 00:08:58,560
Stop looking so bored.

199
00:08:58,940 --> 00:09:01,550
Well, my beer isn't flat and my rack's not saggy.

200
00:09:01,550 --> 00:09:03,880
So far, the future's great.

201
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:07,750
Hey, can I go to the bathroom?

202
00:09:07,750 --> 00:09:09,970
Fine, just try not to look too alive.

203
00:09:09,970 --> 00:09:11,840
That's my jam.

204
00:09:15,140 --> 00:09:17,390
So one of us went back in time to kill Stuart?

205
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:18,360
But why?

206
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:20,300
Perhaps this will help.

207
00:09:20,300 --> 00:09:21,490
