What does your card say, Bernadette?

224
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:06,550
Eh, eh, eh, hang on.

225
00:10:06,550 --> 00:10:08,460
Do-do you think we'd really drift apart

226
00:10:08,460 --> 00:10:10,100
