234
00:10:24,750 --> 00:10:26,690
Well, you don't go into science for the money.

235
00:10:26,690 --> 00:10:27,930
Speak for yourself.

236
00:10:27,930 --> 00:10:29,930
Last month, my company both invented

237
00:10:29,930 --> 00:10:33,280
and cured Restless Eye Syndrome.

238
00:10:35,340 --> 00:10:38,250
Ka-ching, ya blinky chumps.

239
00:10:40,050 --> 00:10:42,210
So, wait, if my career took me somewhere else,

240
00:10:42,210 --> 00:10:43,610
