241
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,990
He started it.

242
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:53,130
Okay, okay, guys-- new back stories.

243
00:10:53,130 --> 00:10:55,750
Uh, Penny and Leonard, you two lovebirds are

244
00:10:55,750 --> 00:10:58,470
super successful and living in New York.

245
00:10:58,470 --> 00:11:00,070
Uh, you're an actress, you're a professor

246
00:11:00,070 --> 00:11:01,970
and you have three beautiful kids.

247
00:11:01,970 --> 00:11:02,540
Great.

248
00:11:02,540 --> 00:11:03,710
Really? You think I'm putting

249
00:11:03,710 --> 00:11:05,770
this body through three kids?

250
00:11:08,350 --> 00:11:09,980
Okay, let's do this.

251
00:11:09,980 --> 00:11:11,040
Good luck.

252
00:11:11,040 --> 00:11:12,070
You...

253
00:11:12,070 --> 00:11:13,610
Aren't you gonna come with me?

254
00:11:13,610 --> 00:11:16,220
While you confront your mother about her sex life?

255
00:11:16,220 --> 00:11:19,760
I'd rather go back to that bar in ass-less chaps.

256
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,680
Mother?

257
00:11:27,210 --> 00:11:28,150
Mother.

258
00:11:28,540 --> 00:11:29,740
Mother?

259
00:11:30,140 --> 00:11:33,030
Shelly! I'm so glad you're here!

260
00:11:33,030 --> 00:11:35,350
I saw you having naked sex.

261
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:39,360
What are you talking about?

262
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:41,650
Earlier, I came here to surprise you.

263
00:11:41,650 --> 00:11:44,580
I looked in the window and I saw you with a man.

264
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:47,980
Oh, Shelly, I'm so sorry.

265
00:11:47,980 --> 00:11:49,410
Come in.

266
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:55,370
Maybe we should sit down

267
00:11:55,370 --> 00:11:57,630
